===Etymology 1===
{{etymid|en|mesh}}
{{etymon|en|id=mesh|:inh|enm:net<id:mesh>|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|net}}, from {{inh|en|ang|net}}, {{m|ang|nett}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*nati}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*natją|t=net}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*neHd-|t=to knot, turn, twist}}.
{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|frr|näät|t=net}}, {{cog|stq|Nät|t=net}}, {{cog|fy,nl|net|t=net}}, {{cog|de,lb|Netz|t=net}}, {{cog|yi|נעץ|t=net}}, {{cog|da,ovd,fo,is|net|t=net}}, {{cog|nb|nett|t=net}}, {{cog|nn|net}}, {{m|nn|nett|t=net}}, {{cog|sv|nät|t=net}}, {{cog|got|𐌽𐌰𐍄𐌹|t=net}}.
