====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{senseid|en|Q986291}} A [[mesh]] of [[string]], [[cord]] or [[rope]].
#: {{ux|en|a [[hairnet|hair'''net''']]; a [[mosquito net|mosquito '''net''']]; a tennis '''net'''}}
# A device made from such mesh, used for [[catch]]ing fish, butterflies, etc.
#* {{RQ:Lincoln Pratt's Patients|chapter=1|passage=Then there came a reg'lar terror of a sou'wester same as you don't get one summer in a thousand, and blowed the shanty flat and ripped about half of the weir poles out of the sand. We spent consider'ble money getting 'em reset, and then a swordfish got into the pound and tore the '''nets''' all to slathers, right in the middle of the squiteague season.}}
# A device made from such mesh, generally used for [[trap]]ping something.
#* {{quote-book|en|title=The Book of Sharks|author={{w|Richard Ellis (biologist)|Richard Ellis}}|year=1983|publisher=Knopf|ISBN=0679722106|passage=The '''nets''' have to be checked to make sure that they are not tangled up and therefore useless, and the carcasses of the dead sharks are removed.|page=190}}
# Anything that has the appearance of such a device.
#: {{ux|en|Petri '''net'''}}
# {{lb|en|by extension}} A [[trap]].
#* {{RQ:KJV|Proverbs|xxix|5|text=A man that flattereth his neighbor spreadeth a '''net''' for his feet.}}
#: {{ux|en|caught in the prosecuting attorney's '''net'''}}
# {{lb|en|geometry}} Any set of [[polygon]]s joined edge to edge that, when folded along the edges between adjoining polygons so that the outer edges touch, form a given [[polyhedron]].
# A [[system]] that [[interconnect|interconnects]] a number of users, locations etc. allowing transport or communication between them.
## {{lb|en|electronics}} A [[conductor]] that interconnects two or more [[component]] [[terminal]]s.
# {{lb|en|sports}} A framework backed by a mesh, serving as the [[goal]] in [[hockey]], [[soccer]], [[lacrosse]], etc.
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=December 29, 2010|author=Mark Vesty|work=BBC
|title=Wigan 2-2 Arsenal
|url=http://news.bbc.co.uk/sport1/hi/football/eng_prem/9322845.stm
|passage=Wigan had N'Zogbia sent off late on but Squillaci headed into his own '''net''' to give the home side a deserved point.}}
#: {{ux|en|The striker headed the ball into the '''net''' to make it 1-0.}}
# {{lb|en|sports|tennis}} A mesh stretched to divide the [[court]] in [[tennis]], [[badminton]], [[volleyball]], etc.
# {{lb|en|tennis|by extension}} The area of the court close to the net (mesh stretched to divide the court).

